usecase-beta
direction LR
actor Customer
actor Auditor
systemBoundary Shop(Order service)@{type:package}
Browse(Browse)
Checkout(Checkout)
Pay[Payment]
Receipt(Receipt)
end
Customer --> Browse
Customer --> Checkout
Browse --> Checkout
Checkout ..>:include Pay
Pay --> Receipt
Receipt ..>:extend Checkout
Auditor --> Receipt
Auditor --o Pay
Auditor --x Browse
note for Pay "Review payment"
